    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Tenno, a 2D MMO Turn-Based RPG that lets you become the ultimate ninja! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic ninja RPGs, Tenno delivers thrilling strategic combat, deep character customization, and an expansive ninja world reminiscent of your favorite anime adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 Elemental Villages: Choose Fire, Water, Wind, Earth, or Thunder, each with its own academy and unique jutsu to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn Legendary Techniques: Train in the ways of Ninjutsu, Taijutsu, and Genjutsu, unlocking powerful jutsu and secret techniques as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Your Ninja: Stand out on the battlefield with six types of custom items: outfits, weapons, back items, hairstyles, faces, and details like masks or tattoos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Tactical Battles: Engage in turn-based combat, using your elemental powers and jutsu to outsmart enemies and rival ninjas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Epic Events: Unlock rare items and exclusive jutsu through limited-time seasonal events, keeping your ninja equipped for any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a world where your ninja destiny awaits\u2014master the elements, customize your character, and engage in thrilling battles in Tenno!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Tenno, a 2D MMO Turn-Based RPG that lets you become the ultimate ninja! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic ninja RPGs, Tenno delivers thrilling strategic combat, deep character customization, and an expansive ninja world reminiscent of your favorite anime adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 Elemental Villages: Choose Fire, Water, Wind, Earth, or Thunder, each with its own academy and unique jutsu to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn Legendary Techniques: Train in the ways of Ninjutsu, Taijutsu, and Genjutsu, unlocking powerful jutsu and secret techniques as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Your Ninja: Stand out on the battlefield with six types of custom items: outfits, weapons, back items, hairstyles, faces, and details like masks or tattoos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Tactical Battles: Engage in turn-based combat, using your elemental powers and jutsu to outsmart enemies and rival ninjas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Epic Events: Unlock rare items and exclusive jutsu through limited-time seasonal events, keeping your ninja equipped for any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a world where your ninja destiny awaits\u2014master the elements, customize your character, and engage in thrilling battles in Tenno!</p>",
